# Handover

1. Read `dev_minions/HANDOVER.md`, `git branch --show-current`, `git status --short`, `git log --oneline -5`.
2. If there are uncommitted changes that compile and are coherent, commit them on the story branch (`wip(US-XXX): …`). If they are broken, commit anyway with `wip(US-XXX): BROKEN — <what is broken>` rather than lose them. Never discard work.
3. Rewrite the "Active story" section: story, branch, phase, round, criteria done/remaining, currently failing tests (names), and the **exact next step** a different agent should take first (a concrete command or file + change).
4. Update "Waiting on the user" (QA, decisions, escalations, denied permissions).
5. Add one line to the Log (newest first). Update the "Last updated" line with the time and "Claude Code".
6. `git add dev_minions/HANDOVER.md && git commit -m "chore(handover): <phase> US-XXX"`.
7. Reply with the "Exact next step" line only.
